<title>AUSTRIA: Austria says CA sale wrapped up before year-end.</title>
<headline>Austria says CA sale wrapped up before year-end.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian Finance Minister Viktor Klima on Monday said he would choose the winning offer for privatisation candidate Creditanstalt-Bankverein before year-end.</p>
<p>&quot;We will make a decision before the end of the year,&quot; Klima told Austrian radio. Earlier, the ministry said it had received three bids for the state's 70 percent voting stake in the country's flagship bank.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
